│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ minimax_kvpr_local                                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ The original approach uses a single greedy ordering by `req_rate / slo` and chooses the   │
│                          │ GPU with the lowest *current* KVPR before adding a model. This can produce poor           │
│                          │ placements because it ignores the model's memory and pressure impact after placement.     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The new implementation uses:                                                              │
│                          │ - Multiple deterministic model orderings: pressure-first, size-first, and                 │
│                          │ pressure-density-first.                                                                   │
│                          │ - Two placement tie-break configurations: capacity-preserving and best-fit packing.       │
│                          │ - Post-placement KVPR evaluation: each candidate GPU is evaluated using its KVPR after    │
│                          │ receiving the model.                                                                      │
│                          │ - Local-search refinement with model moves and pairwise swaps.                            │
│                          │ - `MAX_LOCAL_PASSES=24` and `EPSILON=1e-12` as bounded optimization parameters.           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ It selects the best feasible multi-start placement, then improves it by accepting only    │
│                          │ moves or swaps that strictly reduce the maximum KVPR.                                     │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0402                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
