│ patch_name               │ threshold_binpack                                                                         │
│ patch_description        │ This implementation reformulates the minimax KVPR objective as a sequence of bin-packing  │
│                          │ feasibility tests. For a target pressure `T`, a GPU satisfies `load / remaining <= T`     │
│                          │ exactly when the sum of transformed item costs `weight + T * size` is at most `80 * T`.   │
│                          │ This converts the ratio-balancing problem into scalar capacity packing.                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The algorithm binary-searches the smallest feasible pressure and uses several             │
│                          │ deterministic best-fit packing orders at each threshold. This is fundamentally different  │
│                          │ from direct greedy KVPR placement and local move/swap descent: it searches the objective  │
│                          │ value globally, while the packing routine constructs a placement that proves feasibility  │
│                          │ for that value.                                                                           │
