│ patch_description        │ Replace the placement decision based on a GPU's current KVPR with one based on the        │
│                          │ maximum KVPR after the model is actually assigned. This directly optimizes the stated     │
│                          │ objective at every greedy step. Models are ordered by their intrinsic pressure when       │
│                          │ placed on an otherwise empty GPU, which prioritizes models that are difficult due to      │
│                          │ either high request pressure or large memory size. A small relocation refinement then     │
│                          │ moves models away from bottleneck GPUs whenever doing so strictly reduces the global      │
│                          │ maximum KVPR while maintaining memory feasibility.                                        │
