│ patch_name               │ bottleneck_swaps                                                                          │
│ patch_description        │ Add a pairwise-swap local search after single-model relocations. Relocation-only search   │
│                          │ can get stuck when the bottleneck GPU cannot give away a model because no target has      │
│                          │ enough free memory, even though exchanging it with a smaller model on another GPU is      │
│                          │ feasible. This search evaluates feasible swaps involving a current bottleneck GPU and     │
│                          │ applies the swap that strictly lowers the global maximum KVPR, repeating until no         │
│                          │ improving exchange remains.                                                               │
