│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ multistart_kvpr_packing                                                                   │
│ patch_description        │ This version improves placement quality using deterministic multi-start greedy packing    │
│                          │ and lexicographic KVPR balancing.                                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ It tries several complementary model orderings, including pressure-first, size-first,     │
│                          │ pressure-per-remaining-memory, pressure density, and size/pressure tradeoffs. For each    │
│                          │ ordering, models are placed on the GPU producing the best sorted KVPR vector, rather than │
│                          │ only minimizing one GPU’s immediate pressure.                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The best seeds are then refined with relocation and swap local search. Local search       │
│                          │ accepts lexicographic improvements to the complete sorted KVPR vector, so it can improve  │
│                          │ secondary GPU pressures even when the maximum KVPR is unchanged, enabling later           │
│                          │ improvements that simple maximum-only local search misses. All moves and swaps preserve   │
│                          │ GPU memory feasibility.                                                                   │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
