│ patch_description        │ Replace the single intrinsic-pressure ordering with several complementary feasible        │
│                          │ packing seeds and retain the one with the lowest actual maximum KVPR before refinement.   │
│                          │ KVPR placement has two competing constraints: high-load models should be balanced, while  │
│                          │ large models must preserve memory for later placements. A single ordering can make an     │
│                          │ early irreversible fragmentation decision. The new seeds prioritize intrinsic pressure,   │
│                          │ model size, raw load, and transformed load-to-memory pressure, while every placement      │
│                          │ choice directly minimizes the projected global KVPR. The existing move, swap, and         │
│                          │ pair-move local search then refines a substantially stronger initial solution without     │
│                          │ changing its logic.                                                                       │
