│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ pair_relocation_refinement                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ Add a pair-relocation refinement after the existing single-move and swap local search. A  │
│                          │ placement can be stuck when neither high-pressure model can individually move to another  │
│                          │ GPU without exceeding its KVPR, while moving two complementary models together            │
│                          │ substantially reduces the bottleneck. This directly expands the neighborhood searched by  │
│                          │ the optimizer while preserving memory feasibility and only accepting strict improvements  │
