│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ threshold_kvpr_packing                                                                    │
│ patch_description        │ This version adds a KVPR-threshold packing phase. For a target pressure `p`, each model   │
│                          │ is transformed into a bin-packing size:                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ `model_size + (req_rate / slo) / p`                                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ If transformed models fit in an 80 GB bin, that GPU is guaranteed to have KVPR at most    │
│                          │ `p`. The algorithm binary-searches useful pressure thresholds, tries several transformed  │
│                          │ packing orders, evaluates every successful assignment by its true KVPR, and retains the   │
│                          │ best result instead of accepting the first feasible packing.                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ It also preserves diversified greedy constructions and improves every candidate using     │
│                          │ relocations and swaps. Candidate comparison is lexicographic: minimum maximum KVPR, then  │
│                          │ minimum second-highest pressure, then maximum remaining GPU memory.                       │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0453                                                                                   │
