│                          │ `middle` because greedy bin packing leaves slack. Repacking at this tighter verified      │
│                          │ target can produce a better seed for local search. The best seed is retained according to │
│                          │ the actual lexicographic pressure key instead of simply replacing it with the most recent │
│                          │ binary-search candidate.                                                                  │
