│ patch_name               │ threshold_exchange_search                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ The previous approach used 24 pressure-threshold bisection rounds, 60 local-search        │
│                          │ rounds, and improved only 6 seeds with single relocations and 1-for-1 swaps. This version │
│                          │ increases threshold resolution to 30 rounds, retains 8 high-quality seeds, and uses 80    │
│                          │ improvement rounds.                                                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The main improvement is a bounded 2-for-1 exchange neighborhood. When a high-pressure GPU │
│                          │ cannot improve through a single move or swap because of memory fragmentation, the         │
│                          │ algorithm tries exchanging two small models from one of the highest-pressure GPUs for one │
│                          │ compatible model from another GPU. Exchanges are restricted to the two most pressured     │
│                          │ GPUs and at most 12 candidate models per GPU, preserving low runtime while escaping local │
│                          │ minima. All moves verify GPU memory exactly and are accepted only when the lexicographic  │
│                          │ pressure score strictly improves.                                                         │
