│                          │ This version keeps the transformed KVPR formulation but changes the construction strategy │
│                          │ to best-fit decreasing in transformed capacity `load + threshold * size`. For every       │
│                          │ threshold, it greedily places the prefix and uses a bounded exact recursive completion    │
│                          │ for the final 7 models (`TAIL_EXACT_MODELS = 7`, `MAX_TAIL_NODES = 40000`). The fallback  │
│                          │ only accepts a concrete feasible completion, so failed recursion never incorrectly claims │
│                          │ infeasibility. It also uses 22 threshold iterations and 28 local-search passes, retaining │
│                          │ efficient move and swap refinement afterward.                                             │
